                              <li>{t('Pa MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE dhe pa READ_CALENDAR — kalon rishikimin e Google Play pa pengesa.', 'No MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE or READ_CALENDAR — passes Google Play policy checks cleanly.')}</li>
